  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIVICUS Strengthening 21st century citizen action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to CIVICUS to develop dedicated capacity to design, test and scale new initiatives that aim to strengthen citizen action in the 21st century. Two priority areas in which they feel thoughtful innovation could have a significant positive impact:
&#x2022; Support to individual activists and new generation changemakers who may not work within or associate themselves with organised civil society; and 
&#x2022; More direct and democratic resourcing of smaller and spontaneous civil society</narrative>
  </description>
